d a passing probe are ALREADY_APPLIED; proved old fingerprints are NOT_APPLIED; a replaced container, partial fingerprint match, or conflicting target is INDETERMINATE."},"status":{"effect_class":"OBSERVATION","reconciliation":"Replay the typed local, host, and vault status probes; absence is an explicit observed state, never a skipped success."},"verify":{"effect_class":"OBSERVATION","reconciliation":"Replay every selected bounded probe and retain its typed result; no selected target may be silently skipped."}},"dry_run_rule":"dry_run=true performs no credential read or mutation and terminalizes only as DRY_RUN, never APPLIED.","secret_rule":"Credential contents never enter argv, logs, journal events, terminal artifacts, or error text. The owner may retain only a non-secret content SHA-256 and provider/resource version identifiers."},"policy_sha256":"8fc463829f1d9931e35fc82ddb68678fe483d50d9248c9ddfc14b1c70056e330","required_clause_ids":["00fc3db8be885aeb4fc4da4d18b9028a45f364b67bafcf0dd667e5ce3e3bc522","0ece08d7f75eab210a57285f3793d944dc80712a4f2cc4748b44bab795c5cb9e","1bfeef992fd9a2eb22d46eb6100da6b46822895e0f84dbfe7b2566892f5e8a2d","2689102f1038a84edcb63a925d69c79ede0b3ad56987deab7cbe096588e9b175","3ede3fc0c3b9ef29ff4121411a105a07300eb2633de9a3b15fed5c58e9fbe2be","462c90796cb63b8d68ca48d3b3eec34b5dbd42efe5c37ad57895781cb4281f60","497cc4cfd8ef69c45f22a4d9ab5190c185d0531a0bdd5853e87ce947323f59e3","4b76d8c38eeb57e20bece2d6ec952fefc2bfadd96d78453c111e317d302da965","665917cf0e19376195c28065d0e4832de3cef03a119c5012e0eca7b5485255cb","6adc91ab0d4dad55f83d3171e105de4f7fc5918dcf97c98fc735c48cc0470bd7","75be367844cb13343135c682744c7f48b3b63d5ceda2984a74c1b4f30630b8ab","7d539dbf6e57eb597d346261fa30a55e5415801ca34d06dd17f765b8c9c29c18","855989f8775997d427fb62b9c140628a01beeacf700ae8ac67aeb15d4f8ce383","9ddbeb1f27fa7214587e8dbd6f193f869650ff6ab7e7a9ecb7113d97b3e0b733","9fdfe8cbdabc5f4923bb17b44d701dd2c60572b30ef4fc7ad89932591ce66789","b125792d0f60dd602448b0ce6e9403ad126bcd3ca